{
  "profile-schema": "flexcore-profile-v1",
  "profile-id": "vpp-operator",
  "name": "VPP Operator Composition",
  "version": "0.5.0",
  "description": "Registry, telemetry, flexibility, scheduler, audit, console, and selected site connectors (report section 5.8; PLAN.md section 1). Still simulation/shadow in v0.5.0: dispatch.authorize and dispatch.issue are never grantable, and the control-authority mode stays a deployment setting the profile cannot touch.",
